for duplications and sequence evolution</article-title><source>RECOMB '04</source><year>2004</year><fpage>326</fpage><lpage>335</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rambaut</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Grassly</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Seq-gen: An application for the Monte Carlo Simulation of DNA sequence evolution along phylogenetic trees</article-title><source>Comp Appl Biosci</source><year>1997</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>238</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9183526</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>